OL,3,GNEWSALibrary's first edition reveals
OL,4,AAusten's early fans
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr James Ford, curator of Longleat
OL,7,FHouse, said the estate had "a wonderful
OL,8,Fgroup of early Jane Austen editions",
OL,9,Fincluding Emma and Pride and Prejudice.
